[0.068, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\u001b[0 q\r\u001b[25A\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m> Please build a macOS desktop Markdown chat application in this project using `flutter_markdown_plus` with the\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  following features:\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  1. A collapsible macOS split-view conversation thread sidebar with per-thread typing state, automatic thread titling,\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  and starter threads showcasing rich Markdown.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  2. Markdown message rendering (headings, bold/italic/strikethrough, inline and fenced code blocks, blockquotes,\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  lists, and GitHub-style tables) with a one-click Copy Markdown button on every message bubble.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[34;1m  3. A Markdown composer that restores focus after sending, with a formatting toolbar (Bold, Italic, Inline Code, Code\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[34;1mBlock, List, Blockquote), a live Markdown preview toggle, and desktop keyboard shortcu"]
