[0.0, "o", " formatting toolbar (Bold, Italic, Inline Code, Code\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  Block, List, Blockquote), a live Markdown preview toggle, and desktop keyboard shortcuts (`Enter` or `Numpad Enter`\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  to send, `Shift + Enter` for a newline with an IME composition guard).\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  4. A responsive top toolbar with Light and Dark Material 3 theme switching.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[34;1m  5. Widget tests in `test/widget_test.dart` and macOS build/run instructions in `README.md`.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m\u25cb\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 3m 22s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(Initial implementation focuses on the message bubble widget, incorporating Markdown rendering...)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 7 files \u001b[37m(pubspec.yaml, main.dart, widget_test.dart, +4)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(flutter pub add flutter_markdown_plus markdown)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[32m\u25cf\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mEdited\u001b[m 7 files \u001b[37m(chat_models.dart, chat_repository.dart, chat_view_model.dart, +4)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u28fb  \u001b[90mEditing fi\u001b[94mles..\u001b[90m.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[90m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500"]
